    Office Use Only: 1-19-320 2-26-130 3-32,940 4-39,750 5-46,560 6-53,370 7-60,180 8-66,990
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header">RELEASE OF RECORDS CERTIFICATION</div>
  <div class="header">CERTIFICATION</div>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">With my signature, I hereby grant permission to the staff of the Colorado State University, The Access Center, and specifically the Upward Bound Program, to access my child's school records, including grades, test scores, attendance, class progress, free or reduced lunch eligibility.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">I hereby authorize post-secondary institutions to release to Upward Bound copies of <span data-field="academic_records_type">{{ academic_records_type }}</span>, <span data-field="enrollment_records_type">{{ enrollment_records_type }}</span>, and <span data-field="student_aid_records_type">{{ student_aid_records_type }}</span> information at any college/university my child attends or will be attending.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">These records will be used to assess student needs, monitor student progress, document eligibility for the program, and report data as required by the U.S. Department of Education.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">All information will be kept confidential. The information (except for free or reduced lunch eligibility which will not be released) shall only be transferred to a third party outside the Access Center and the Upward Bound Program on the condition that consent of the parent/guardian (or applicant, if over 18) is first obtained.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Our signatures indicate that to the best of our knowledge, the information provided on this application is true, complete and accurate.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">As a parent or guardian signing this form, I give permission for my child to participate in all program sponsored activities. I also give permission for the use of my child's name and/or photograph for editorial, promotional, recruitment, or educational purposes.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div>Parent Signature: _________________________</div>
    <div>Date: _________________________</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>Student Signature: _________________________</div>
      <div>Student Social Security Number: <span data-field="student_ssn">{{ student_ssn }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">STUDENT AGREEMENT</div>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">If accepted into the program, I agree to attain personal, academic, and college-prep goals that Upward Bound and I set for myself. I also agree to treat myself, other Upward Bound students, and staff with respect, and to be a positive representative of the program.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">What is Upward Bound?</div>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Upward Bound is a precollegiate program funded by the U.S. Department of Education and sponsored by Colorado State University. Upward Bound assists high school students with academic potential in developing the motivation and skills necessary to succeed in high school and enter college.</p>

  <div class="section-title">What is Upward Bound?</div>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Upward Bound provides:</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Regular academic, personal, and college-prep advising for students at their high school, to help students set and reach their goals.</li>
    <li>Saturday sessions (UB University) help improve skills and performance in class and are 1-2 times a semester.</li>
    <li>Educational and cultural events and college visits to enrich student's experience and knowledge.</li>
    <li>A stipend for full effort and participation in Upward Bound.</li>
    <li>Assistance in securing admission and financial aid for college.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">During the Summer Program, Upward Bound Provides:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>A six-week intensive academic program.</li>
    <li>Individualized instruction through classes in math, literature, composition, laboratory science, foreign language, and college preparation.</li>
    <li>Recreational, cultural, and personal enrichment activities.</li>
    <li>High quality instructional and supervisory personnel.</li>
  </ul>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="" alt="Logo" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">UPWARD BOUND</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">COLORADO STATE UNIVERSITY</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">Remember, your application is not complete until you have submitted all of the following:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>The Application form, including student and family information, financial information, academic information (essay & progress report), and agreement sections</li>
    <li>The Release of Records page signed by parent or guardian</li>
    <li>Two recommendations from teachers or counselors who know you well</li>
    <li>A signed copy of your family's tax return for the most recent year (if you filed)</li>
    <li>A list of amounts and sources of income for last year (if you did not file)</li>
    <li>A photocopy of Certificate of Immunization, signed by a doctor or nurse</li>
    <li>Completed W-9 Form Filled out by the Student (during entrance interview)</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Upward Bound is a Federal TRIO Program, which is part of the Access Center at Colorado State University.</p>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 30px;">If you have any questions please call the Upward Bound Office.</p>

